<title>EGYPT: Egypt cotton prices stable for eight varieties.</title>
<headline>Egypt cotton prices stable for eight varieties.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Export prices for Egypt's eight varieties of cotton were unchanged from last week, in line with world prices, an official at the Alexandria Cotton Exporters Association said on Sunday.</p>
<p>The association said in a statement the prices for all grades and varieties are valid until midnight (2200 gmt) October 26, 1996. The prices in centilibres are:</p>
<p>	   FG/EX   FG+1/4   FG	FG-1/4   G/FG   G+3/8   G+1/4</p>
<p>Giza 76  171.0   165.0    159.0   153.0    147.0  144.0    --</p>
<p>Giza 70  164.0   158.0    152.0   146.0    140.0  137.0    --</p>
<p>Giza 77  159.0   153.0    147.0   141.0    135.0  132.0    --</p>
<p>Giza 86  139.0   133.0    127.0   121.0    115.0  112.0    --</p>
<p>Giza 75  134.0   128.0    122.0   116.0    110.0  107.0    --</p>
<p>Giza 85  131.0   125.0    119.0   113.0    107.0  104.0    --</p>
<p>Giza 83  127.0   121.0    115.0   109.0    103.0  100.0    --</p>
<p>Giza 80  127.0   121.0    115.0   109.0    103.0  100.0    --</p>
<p>Note: FG/EX = fully good/excellent, G/FG = good/fully good</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/91</p>
